	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0501_sage6_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あらためて　なのりましょう
わたしの　なまえは　ロット　です▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:21:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:12:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あらためて　名乗りましょう
わたしの　名前は　ロット　です▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:21:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:12:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・c05でのイベント後、主人公少し歩いて
　所定の位置に到達するとイベント開始
・続けてswrival_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:18:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SAGE6
元プラズマ団・七賢人ロット</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:51:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
