	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0501_swrival_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName ]！
オレは　ポケモンジムに　いく▼
もっと　つよくなって　プラズマだんを
ぜんいん　やっつけるッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-04T10:34:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-04T10:33:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName ]！
オレは　ポケモンジムに　行く▼
もっと　強くなって　プラズマ団を
全員　やっつけるッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-04T10:34:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-04T10:33:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・主人公と向き合ってメッセージ表示
・メッセージ後、室外へダッシュで移動
・続けてsage6_06
・0＝主人公名
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-04T10:34:32" />
		</CommentCell>
